  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Development candidate: support indexed JSR/JMP and the additional MOVE/MOVEA, ADD/ADDA/SUBA, ANDI, NOT, CMPI and MOVEM operand forms reached by Kickstart 1.3 CopperHDF boot and native Fast RAM allocation/file I/O on 68020/68EC020. Cover signed and scaled addressing, PC extension bases, flags, stack alignment and register aliasing. Full index extensions remain explicitly unsupported on these advanced paths; 68040 retains its existing fallback. Timing remains a bounded accelerator policy, not hardware certification.",
